<div class="mandarin-hanzi">茶</div>
<div class="mandarin-pinyin">chá</div>

''Meaning:'' tea  
''Part of speech:'' noun

!! In context
他每天早上喝茶。 — Tā měitiān zǎoshang hē chá. — He drinks tea every morning.

!! Usage note
A mass noun for tea. A serving is typically 一杯茶 (yì bēi chá, 'a cup of tea').
